1
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,440
I am establishing a country.

2
00:00:08,440 --> 00:00:10,970
I now call this land, Mount Liang.

3
00:00:12,350 --> 00:00:15,770
You will act as Song Jiang's mistress.

4
00:00:15,770 --> 00:00:19,400
I have made love to Deng Li Hua.

5
00:00:19,400 --> 00:00:22,030
They have established their perch.

6
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:25,040
Our fight is not over.

7
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,150
The author for this script remains at large.

8
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:29,870
It seems you have an idea who this author is.

9
00:00:29,870 --> 00:00:31,600
Ma Gui has a daughter.

10
00:00:31,600 --> 00:00:33,240
Her name is Po Xi.

11
00:00:33,240 --> 00:00:35,590
The people's pleas ought to be your orders.

12
00:00:35,590 --> 00:00:37,850
We call this, the mandate of Heaven.

13
00:00:37,850 --> 00:00:40,940
Yang Zhi, the Blue-faced Beast.

14
00:00:40,940 --> 00:00:46,150
They raised the price of salt,
and cornered Chao Gai.

15
00:00:46,150 --> 00:00:48,210
Qinglian Temple.

16
00:01:22,060 --> 00:01:27,240
[Anqiu]

17
00:01:28,076 --> 00:01:32,416
[Finale]

18
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:39,290
[Ji Ren Mei, Brothel maid]

19
00:01:47,420 --> 00:01:48,550
Cao Zheng!

20
00:01:48,550 --> 00:01:50,505
[Cao Zheng, Brothel proprietor (Ally)]

21
00:01:50,505 --> 00:01:55,025
- How are you, old friend?
- Lu Zhi Shen.

22
00:02:07,160 --> 00:02:11,660
Sir Yang Zhi, the sun has already risen.

23
00:02:15,310 --> 00:02:17,630
So bright...

24
00:02:17,630 --> 00:02:20,370
I see you have recovered your appetite.

25
00:02:27,020 --> 00:02:30,790
But you must eat more to remain lively.

26
00:02:31,850 --> 00:02:34,160
Lively, is it?

27
00:02:35,425 --> 00:02:38,420
Some folks cannot even acquire food.

28
00:02:38,420 --> 00:02:41,530
You must not waste any of it.

29
00:02:41,530 --> 00:02:45,870
My life no longer has meaning.

30
00:03:08,540 --> 00:03:10,160
What is it?

31
00:03:12,610 --> 00:03:14,450
Does this scare you?

32
00:03:17,450 --> 00:03:19,540
Do you fear swords?

33
00:03:26,600 --> 00:03:28,170
My apologies.

34
00:03:29,490 --> 00:03:31,580
Yang Zhi!

35
00:03:36,216 --> 00:03:39,550
Ah, if it isn't Lu Zhi Shen.

36
00:03:39,550 --> 00:03:42,480
We meet again, Yang Zhi.

37
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:46,600
Won't you spar with me, Yang Zhi?

38
00:03:46,600 --> 00:03:48,560
Cao Zheng.

39
00:03:48,560 --> 00:03:52,135
You have given me a roof and meal.

40
00:03:52,135 --> 00:03:54,235
Why must I fight my savior?

41
00:03:55,215 --> 00:03:57,150
When I mentioned your strength,

42
00:03:57,150 --> 00:04:01,150
he insisted on testing the Blue-faced Beast.

43
00:04:01,150 --> 00:04:04,545
I am quite confident in my skills.

44
00:04:04,545 --> 00:04:07,935
I have never once lost while in Kaifeng.

45
00:04:09,570 --> 00:04:11,410
So he says.

46
00:04:21,660 --> 00:04:25,830
It is my loss. Forgive me!

47
00:04:26,885 --> 00:04:28,910
But of course.

48
00:04:28,910 --> 00:04:31,040
I am indebted to you.

49
00:04:31,940 --> 00:04:37,220
If not for your generosity,
I'd have been beast-food by now.

50
00:04:38,375 --> 00:04:40,520
Let us raise a toast together.

51
00:04:40,520 --> 00:04:44,150
Liquor is how us men apologize, right?

52
00:04:44,150 --> 00:04:46,215
You must understand, Yang Zhi.

53
00:04:46,215 --> 00:04:48,355
He is simply an honest fool.

54
00:04:49,625 --> 00:04:51,550
No harm in that.

55
00:04:51,550 --> 00:04:53,232
I shall accept your offer.

56
00:04:54,715 --> 00:04:56,980
Drinks, at this early hour?

57
00:04:56,980 --> 00:05:00,290
Sorry to cause a commotion, Ji Ren Mei.

58
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:10,830
Yang Zhi, there is something
I would like you to see.

59
00:05:17,125 --> 00:05:18,690
Is this...

60
00:05:18,690 --> 00:05:20,675
Like a wasteland, no?

61
00:05:20,675 --> 00:05:24,905
Even the Devil himself would avert his gaze.

62
00:05:25,825 --> 00:05:28,060
Another village, gone.

63
00:05:28,060 --> 00:05:29,660
"Another"?

64
00:05:30,595 --> 00:05:34,020
Then you've witnessed
a similar scenery before?

65
00:05:34,020 --> 00:05:35,580
I have.

66
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:39,130
I could not do a thing.

67
00:05:41,385 --> 00:05:46,270
Do you realize you carry an honorable sword?

68
00:05:46,270 --> 00:05:50,800
The village had long been ravaged.
No bandits remained, either.

69
00:05:53,190 --> 00:05:55,250
I am once again too late.

70
00:06:00,495 --> 00:06:01,780
What was that?

71
00:06:01,780 --> 00:06:03,600
Does someone remain?

72
00:06:05,070 --> 00:06:06,680
Answer me.

73
00:06:19,460 --> 00:06:21,160
Are you alright?

74
00:06:37,810 --> 00:06:39,710
Where are your parents?

75
00:06:53,245 --> 00:06:58,550
What, we had stragglers?

76
00:06:58,550 --> 00:07:00,160
Lucky day.

77
00:07:06,940 --> 00:07:09,200
You despicable scum.

78
00:07:12,660 --> 00:07:14,580
Who the hell?

79
00:07:26,650 --> 00:07:30,120
Filthy men carry filthy swords.

80
00:08:10,125 --> 00:08:12,980
Are there any left alive?

81
00:08:12,980 --> 00:08:15,620
I have vanquished the bandits.

82
00:08:23,650 --> 00:08:25,580
Survivors!

83
00:08:29,325 --> 00:08:31,500
The bandits have left.

84
00:08:31,500 --> 00:08:33,540
You may rest easy.

85
00:08:33,540 --> 00:08:35,520
[Zhou Jin, Village Chief]

86
00:08:35,520 --> 00:08:38,510
You, stranger.

87
00:08:38,510 --> 00:08:42,310
Has our village somehow wronged you?

88
00:08:42,310 --> 00:08:45,040
You have killed so many.

89
00:08:47,125 --> 00:08:49,160
Those bandits will now return.

90
00:08:49,160 --> 00:08:52,850
They will kill every last one of us.

91
00:08:52,850 --> 00:08:57,940
If you had let them be,
they would cease their killings.

92
00:08:57,940 --> 00:09:01,350
They would take our women, and leave us.

93
00:09:01,350 --> 00:09:07,545
For bandits do not consecutively plunder
the same village.

94
00:09:07,545 --> 00:09:09,115
Wait.

95
00:09:10,255 --> 00:09:14,520
Do you not care if your villagers are killed?

96
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:19,590
Do you not care that your women
and belongings are stolen from you?

97
00:09:20,770 --> 00:09:26,840
Then will you remain here,
and protect us from the next attack?

98
00:09:27,635 --> 00:09:30,650
You have agitated the bee's hive.

99
00:09:30,650 --> 00:09:34,910
You have made this village a battlefield.

100
00:09:35,860 --> 00:09:37,350
Sir.

101
00:09:37,995 --> 00:09:40,730
Is that how you wish to lead your lives?

102
00:09:40,730 --> 00:09:45,085
I have protected this village

103
00:09:45,085 --> 00:09:49,245
from the Mount Erlong bandits in my own way.

104
00:09:52,120 --> 00:09:56,830
Does this child have no more relatives?

105
00:09:58,705 --> 00:10:02,810
His parents were killed. He has no one else.

106
00:10:02,810 --> 00:10:06,410
The village cannot look after him.

107
00:10:08,285 --> 00:10:11,120
Abandon the boy as you see fit.

108
00:10:11,120 --> 00:10:13,400
What cruelty.

109
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:17,650
You will abandon a mere child?

110
00:10:17,650 --> 00:10:25,123
We must do away
with such sympathies to survive,

111
00:10:25,123 --> 00:10:27,705
and live another day.

112
00:10:29,140 --> 00:10:32,000
Can you truly call that living a life?

113
00:10:34,215 --> 00:10:37,270
Yes. I can.

114
00:10:37,270 --> 00:10:40,000
Impoverished as it may be.

115
00:10:42,700 --> 00:10:47,550
To live does not mean evading death.

116
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:52,460
Yes. I hear you.

117
00:10:54,020 --> 00:10:58,200
This boy desires to live.

118
00:11:00,625 --> 00:11:02,300
Surely you jest.

119
00:11:02,300 --> 00:11:03,830
Can you not see?

120
00:11:04,730 --> 00:11:09,500
This boy wishes to live...

121
00:11:10,200 --> 00:11:12,580
more than anyone in this village.

122
00:11:43,280 --> 00:11:45,120
Welcome back.

123
00:11:46,375 --> 00:11:48,630
Who is this child?

124
00:11:48,630 --> 00:11:52,520
Ji Ren Mei, please try and calm him.

125
00:11:52,520 --> 00:11:54,910
He fears even my very face.

126
00:11:55,715 --> 00:11:58,770
Children do not care for me.

127
00:11:58,770 --> 00:12:01,410
As such, I do not know how to handle them.

128
00:12:02,280 --> 00:12:06,580
Yang Zhi, he does not fear your face.

129
00:12:07,350 --> 00:12:09,710
It is the blood which scares him.

130
00:12:13,030 --> 00:12:14,630
I see.

131
00:12:15,420 --> 00:12:17,000
I understand.

132
00:12:24,745 --> 00:12:26,850
Do not fear.

133
00:12:26,850 --> 00:12:28,790
You are a man, are you not?

134
00:12:49,555 --> 00:12:52,690
We have the strength to fight.

135
00:12:52,690 --> 00:12:56,690
We can save our people
who are oppressed by those in power.

136
00:12:56,690 --> 00:13:01,480
This fortress shall be a perch
for those who save the weak.

137
00:13:01,480 --> 00:13:05,005
For those who look to the same blue skies.

138
00:13:05,005 --> 00:13:08,105
I now call this land, Mount Liang.

139
00:13:16,785 --> 00:13:19,650
What did Chao Gai write?

140
00:13:19,650 --> 00:13:23,755
He pleads me to join him at Mount Liang.

141
00:13:23,755 --> 00:13:26,825
He fears I am in grave danger.

142
00:13:28,415 --> 00:13:30,770
I suspected as much.

143
00:13:30,770 --> 00:13:32,175
You know of this supposed danger?

144
00:13:32,175 --> 00:13:33,565
Indeed.

145
00:13:34,480 --> 00:13:41,540
I sense someone is watching my every move.

146
00:13:42,823 --> 00:13:45,718
Perhaps you are simply tired.

147
00:13:45,718 --> 00:13:47,188
Tired?

148
00:13:50,175 --> 00:13:52,690
Yes, you may be right.

149
00:13:52,690 --> 00:13:59,020
Yet I am told those from Qinglian Temple
are hidden in plain sight.

150
00:13:59,020 --> 00:14:03,335
My suspicions may very well be on the mark.

151
00:14:03,335 --> 00:14:07,615
Why not join him at Mount Liang?

152
00:14:10,570 --> 00:14:13,830
It is not yet my time.

153
00:14:16,075 --> 00:14:18,940
I appreciate the message, Deng Li Hua.

154
00:14:18,940 --> 00:14:24,450
Please tell Chao Gai
to give me a bit more time.

155
00:14:25,810 --> 00:14:27,250
I shall.

156
00:14:32,650 --> 00:14:35,530
You have been tailing me all day.

157
00:14:36,440 --> 00:14:40,420
What is so fun about that, Qing?

158
00:14:41,690 --> 00:14:44,540
I have a theory I'd like to prove.

159
00:14:45,345 --> 00:14:50,520
I believe I cannot marry Deng Li Hua,
because of your circumstances.

160
00:14:50,520 --> 00:14:53,125
What circumstances?

161
00:14:53,125 --> 00:14:57,695
Brother, you are no mere clerk for Yuncheng.

162
00:14:59,165 --> 00:15:01,350
Calm yourself.

163
00:15:01,350 --> 00:15:05,950
I only ask for a proper explanation.

164
00:15:05,950 --> 00:15:07,810
Oh, bother.

165
00:15:07,810 --> 00:15:11,270
Your stubbornness has not changed.

166
00:15:11,270 --> 00:15:16,310
Even as a child,
you hated leaving questions unanswered.

167
00:15:16,310 --> 00:15:20,425
I believe you have another side to you.

168
00:15:20,425 --> 00:15:23,975
What "other side"? Do tell.

169
00:15:25,075 --> 00:15:27,600
I cannot so openly speak on it.

170
00:15:27,600 --> 00:15:32,060
Yet you spoke to Deng Li Hua

171
00:15:32,060 --> 00:15:34,980
as though she were no mistress.

172
00:15:34,980 --> 00:15:38,540
I can only assume
she is aware of your secret.

173
00:15:40,276 --> 00:15:43,056
Will you speak out against this nation?

174
00:15:46,140 --> 00:15:49,960
I only ask that you tell me your plans.

175
00:16:14,860 --> 00:16:18,180
Fine. I shall tell you everything.

176
00:16:19,095 --> 00:16:21,850
And you promise not to run?

177
00:16:21,850 --> 00:16:24,760
Do you think I would?

178
00:16:25,415 --> 00:16:27,970
No. My apologies.

179
00:16:27,970 --> 00:16:30,330
Now go on.

180
00:16:31,345 --> 00:16:33,150
Yes, Brother.

181
00:16:33,150 --> 00:16:34,830
Qing.

182
00:16:35,915 --> 00:16:39,650
These parts are getting dangerous.

183
00:16:39,650 --> 00:16:42,230
Take care on your way home.

184
00:16:42,230 --> 00:16:45,380
You as well.

185
00:16:54,840 --> 00:16:56,620
Qing.

186
00:16:57,860 --> 00:17:02,820
I am planning no mere uprising.

187
00:17:07,810 --> 00:17:09,720
I am plotting a rebellion.

188
00:17:12,785 --> 00:17:15,730
Sir Han! We were waiting!

189
00:17:15,730 --> 00:17:18,310
Evening, ladies.

190
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:23,370
- Don't look down on...
- I will lay waste to Mount Erlong!

191
00:17:25,705 --> 00:17:28,150
Skipping the preamble, I see.

192
00:17:28,150 --> 00:17:29,560
Do you have a plan?

193
00:17:29,560 --> 00:17:31,650
I will infiltrate the Mount Erlong bandits,

194
00:17:31,650 --> 00:17:36,520
and take the head of their leader, Deng Long,
as well as several others.

195
00:17:36,520 --> 00:17:38,665
That should get them to surrender.

196
00:17:38,665 --> 00:17:39,950
These are basic war strategies.

197
00:17:39,950 --> 00:17:41,980
You plan to barge through the front gates?

198
00:17:41,980 --> 00:17:46,020
Indeed. Lu Zhi Shen and myself
will suffice for manpower.

199
00:17:46,020 --> 00:17:49,140
I must simply find a way in...

200
00:17:49,140 --> 00:17:50,642
I see.

201
00:17:50,642 --> 00:17:52,160
- Cao Zheng.
- Yes?

202
00:17:52,160 --> 00:17:55,860
Now is the time to prove your use.

203
00:17:55,860 --> 00:17:57,610
- Me?
- Yes.

204
00:17:57,610 --> 00:18:00,310
Yang Zhi.

205
00:18:00,310 --> 00:18:03,090
Can you act like a drunkard?

206
00:18:03,090 --> 00:18:05,010
Yes, can you?

207
00:18:05,010 --> 00:18:07,070
Here. Take a sip.

208
00:18:07,070 --> 00:18:09,475
- Go on.
- Yes, go on.

209
00:18:09,475 --> 00:18:12,035
- Drink!
- Eat!

210
00:18:16,895 --> 00:18:19,440
Watch your step, sir.

211
00:18:19,440 --> 00:18:24,320
You can't be getting injured here...

212
00:18:24,320 --> 00:18:26,690
Yang Zhi, sir.

213
00:18:26,690 --> 00:18:29,330
You must act like a proper drunk.

214
00:18:29,330 --> 00:18:31,355
- How?
- Look to thy neighbor.

215
00:18:31,355 --> 00:18:33,565
Bring me the booze.

216
00:18:34,620 --> 00:18:37,430
- I decline.
- If you insist.

217
00:18:38,325 --> 00:18:40,200
The hell are you?

218
00:18:40,200 --> 00:18:43,440
I am the proprietor of a local brothel.

219
00:18:43,440 --> 00:18:45,230
My name is Cao Zheng.

220
00:18:45,230 --> 00:18:47,900
Hey, I know this bloke.

221
00:18:47,900 --> 00:18:51,090
Why'd you bring us men?

222
00:18:51,090 --> 00:18:54,210
We want the women!

223
00:18:54,210 --> 00:18:58,060
My patrons here drunk themselves stupid,

224
00:18:58,060 --> 00:19:04,530
and killed many of your men, or so I heard.

225
00:19:04,530 --> 00:19:05,860
You!

226
00:19:05,860 --> 00:19:07,600
What? You know something?

227
00:19:07,600 --> 00:19:10,980
This is him. I remember the mark.

228
00:19:10,980 --> 00:19:13,975
Follow us, you bastards!

229
00:19:13,975 --> 00:19:16,945
[Mount Erlong]

230
00:19:19,740 --> 00:19:21,900
Unhand me!

231
00:19:28,330 --> 00:19:32,270
[Deng Long, Leader of the bandits]

232
00:19:39,165 --> 00:19:40,980
These are the murderers?

233
00:19:40,980 --> 00:19:42,980
Yes, sir.

234
00:19:42,980 --> 00:19:46,465
I shall reward you for apprehending them.

235
00:19:46,465 --> 00:19:48,435
Thank you, sir.

236
00:19:49,955 --> 00:19:53,080
Now, for your sentences.

237
00:19:53,080 --> 00:19:57,010
We will flay you alive, one finger at a time.

238
00:19:57,765 --> 00:20:01,190
You will beg for a swift death.

239
00:20:01,190 --> 00:20:02,950
Come down.

240
00:20:04,850 --> 00:20:08,410
Then we will cut your arms and legs,

241
00:20:09,360 --> 00:20:11,660
leaving only your body to flail about,

242
00:20:14,755 --> 00:20:18,500
as we slowly gouge out your stomach.

243
00:20:18,500 --> 00:20:21,620
Why won't he come down?

244
00:20:27,495 --> 00:20:31,770
You blabber on,
yet refuse to unsheathe your sword.

245
00:20:31,770 --> 00:20:35,670
Words alone shall not kill us.

246
00:20:35,670 --> 00:20:37,970
You, bald monk!

247
00:20:39,980 --> 00:20:42,160
Do you wish to repeat yourself?

248
00:20:43,650 --> 00:20:46,750
Fine. I will kill you myself.

249
00:21:40,455 --> 00:21:44,600
It is nice to see you again, Song Jiang.

250
00:21:44,600 --> 00:21:48,950
Likewise. It has gotten harder
to meet like this.

251
00:21:56,330 --> 00:21:59,200
Has Deng Li Hua proven to be of use?

252
00:22:00,995 --> 00:22:03,520
She is a beautiful woman.

253
00:22:03,520 --> 00:22:08,100
The perfect accessory
to camouflage oneself as corrupt.

254
00:22:12,665 --> 00:22:17,400
I have come today, seeking your wisdom.

255
00:22:17,400 --> 00:22:19,350
To what ends?

256
00:22:19,350 --> 00:22:23,450
It has gotten difficult
to protect our salt roads.

257
00:22:25,075 --> 00:22:28,900
Why not increase our number of guards?

258
00:22:28,900 --> 00:22:31,350
One can try to disguise a soldier,

259
00:22:31,350 --> 00:22:33,270
but the equipment they carry
make their identities obvious.

260
00:22:33,270 --> 00:22:37,310
It will only make our cargo more suspicious.

261
00:22:37,310 --> 00:22:40,940
The people from Qinglian Temple
will surely catch on.

262
00:22:40,940 --> 00:22:43,020
Indeed.

263
00:22:43,020 --> 00:22:48,980
Perhaps I may have to bribe
some officials myself,

264
00:22:48,980 --> 00:22:53,660
though we will ultimately operate at a loss.

265
00:23:01,950 --> 00:23:04,000
The smuggled salt...

266
00:23:05,520 --> 00:23:07,540
Smuggling...

267
00:23:09,160 --> 00:23:10,800
Undercover...

268
00:23:12,100 --> 00:23:16,620
Perhaps we can ask Gongsun Sheng for his aid.

269
00:23:17,705 --> 00:23:19,980
I see.

270
00:23:19,980 --> 00:23:23,990
The covert Zhisi Squadron.

271
00:23:23,990 --> 00:23:27,480
They excel at disguising themselves.

272
00:23:27,480 --> 00:23:30,670
I will pass the request
to Chao Gai as well.

273
00:23:30,670 --> 00:23:32,750
Thank you, Song Jiang.

274
00:23:36,415 --> 00:23:38,480
Have you been left out again?

275
00:23:38,480 --> 00:23:41,300
Yes.

276
00:23:41,300 --> 00:23:44,020
They've come to discuss important business.

277
00:23:44,020 --> 00:23:48,040
Why can his mistress listen in,
but not myself?

278
00:23:48,730 --> 00:23:52,250
- His mistress?
- Yes, his mistress.

279
00:23:53,810 --> 00:23:56,410
Her name is Deng Li Hua.

280
00:23:58,350 --> 00:23:59,705
Deng Li Hua...

281
00:23:59,705 --> 00:24:04,256
I have made love to Deng Li Hua.

282
00:24:08,730 --> 00:24:13,950
Song Jiang won't tell me a thing.

283
00:24:15,020 --> 00:24:18,840
I am always left in the dark.

284
00:25:26,990 --> 00:25:28,670
You called, Lu Zhi Shen?

285
00:25:31,125 --> 00:25:34,400
I leave this place to you, Yang Zhi.

286
00:25:34,400 --> 00:25:38,100
- Pardon?
- Mount Erlong.

287
00:25:38,100 --> 00:25:44,210
We cannot allow these bandits
to roam free, and plunder villages.

288
00:25:44,210 --> 00:25:47,885
You must take control,
and correct their ways.

289
00:25:47,885 --> 00:25:49,285
What?

290
00:25:50,995 --> 00:25:53,270
You say I should lead these bandits?

291
00:25:53,270 --> 00:25:59,740
Who else could train such ruffians
into men with real ambition?

292
00:26:05,380 --> 00:26:07,840
For you, that is possible, Yang Zhi.

293
00:26:10,170 --> 00:26:13,160
[Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name]

294
00:26:18,328 --> 00:26:21,640
Li Fu, what bothers you so?

295
00:26:21,640 --> 00:26:24,980
The head of Mount Erlong has been killed.

296
00:26:24,980 --> 00:26:27,730
A new leader has been appointed in his place.

297
00:26:27,730 --> 00:26:30,340
And who is this new leader?

298
00:26:31,470 --> 00:26:33,340
Yang Zhi.

299
00:26:34,270 --> 00:26:36,160
Now that is troublesome indeed.

300
00:26:36,865 --> 00:26:42,020
First, Chao Gai. And now, Yang Zhi.

301
00:26:42,020 --> 00:26:45,100
These bandits are not like the others.

302
00:26:45,100 --> 00:26:48,050
What makes them different, if I may ask?

303
00:26:48,050 --> 00:26:51,350
Bandits are united by money alone.

304
00:26:51,350 --> 00:26:53,950
Yet these men crave no riches.

305
00:26:55,425 --> 00:26:57,770
They are united by their ambitions.

306
00:26:57,770 --> 00:26:59,635
No, impossible.

307
00:26:59,635 --> 00:27:03,395
Which is what makes them
especially troublesome.

308
00:27:04,353 --> 00:27:07,193
Though their ambitions may start small,

309
00:27:07,980 --> 00:27:10,670
they will one day
dream of a country of their own.

310
00:27:11,900 --> 00:27:15,620
At which point we are no longer fighting
a gang of bandits, but a nation.

311
00:27:16,330 --> 00:27:19,450
It is not the bandits we need to defeat.

312
00:27:20,085 --> 00:27:23,190
But their very ambitions.

313
00:27:23,190 --> 00:27:28,870
I do feel Mount Liang and Mount Erlong
were conquered in similar ways.

314
00:27:37,350 --> 00:27:40,450
This country is rotten to its core.

315
00:27:41,230 --> 00:27:46,000
And yet, this nation persists.

316
00:27:51,230 --> 00:27:56,620
A rotting finger is no reason
to end one's life.

317
00:28:00,230 --> 00:28:03,500
You must simply cut that rot away.

318
00:28:05,820 --> 00:28:08,660
We will kill the rotting officials.

319
00:28:09,305 --> 00:28:13,330
We will extinguish any ember of a rebellion.

320
00:28:13,330 --> 00:28:19,420
We cannot allow men like Lin Chong
and Lu Zhi Shen to roam free.

321
00:28:20,492 --> 00:28:25,850
There is a captain named Zhu Tong
who was transferred to Yuncheng by Gao Qiu.

322
00:28:25,850 --> 00:28:29,440
He is apparently training a man there

323
00:28:29,440 --> 00:28:32,270
in the way of swordsmanship.

324
00:28:32,270 --> 00:28:34,230
Indeed.

325
00:28:34,230 --> 00:28:37,330
The ambidextrous clerk in Yuncheng,

326
00:28:37,330 --> 00:28:43,100
who deftly utilizes his different scripts.

327
00:28:43,100 --> 00:28:45,300
You know him?

328
00:28:46,705 --> 00:28:50,190
I have already sent Wang He's men to him.

329
00:28:50,190 --> 00:28:52,810
They are looking into his background
as we speak.

330
00:28:53,520 --> 00:28:55,790
We are observing his daily routines.

331
00:28:56,530 --> 00:28:59,160
From what he eats,

332
00:28:59,980 --> 00:29:03,870
to how often he uses the restroom,

333
00:29:03,870 --> 00:29:07,290
to his type in women.

334
00:29:11,450 --> 00:29:18,170
You refer to the man named Song Jiang,
do you not?

335
00:29:26,000 --> 00:29:29,220
Song Jiang!

336
00:30:05,705 --> 00:30:09,150
I apologize for the wait.

337
00:30:09,150 --> 00:30:13,710
Chao Gai, why have you come here?

338
00:30:13,710 --> 00:30:15,980
Because you refuse to come to Mount Liang.

339
00:30:15,980 --> 00:30:20,350
You are the leader of Mount Liang.

340
00:30:20,350 --> 00:30:22,405
As are you.

341
00:30:22,405 --> 00:30:25,855
Do you realize the danger
you put yourself in?

342
00:30:26,545 --> 00:30:29,570
The Qinglian Temple are scouring Yuncheng.

343
00:30:29,570 --> 00:30:31,730
The streets are filled with your posters.

344
00:30:31,730 --> 00:30:33,810
Like you are one to speak.

345
00:30:33,810 --> 00:30:35,045
What?

346
00:30:35,045 --> 00:30:37,985
You are also a target of Qinglian Temple.

347
00:30:40,285 --> 00:30:44,190
I cannot leave for Mount Liang yet.

348
00:30:44,190 --> 00:30:49,110
I killed ten spies from Qinglian Temple
on my way here.

349
00:30:49,110 --> 00:30:56,020
They suspect you, and your people.

350
00:30:56,020 --> 00:31:00,860
Yet you still insist on remaining here?

351
00:31:00,860 --> 00:31:02,610
Chao Gai.

352
00:31:02,610 --> 00:31:06,620
I have come to express my concerns in person,

353
00:31:06,620 --> 00:31:10,060
as it seems my letters did not suffice.

354
00:31:10,060 --> 00:31:14,185
Song Jiang, come to Mount Liang with me.

355
00:31:14,185 --> 00:31:15,975
Chao Gai.

356
00:31:17,495 --> 00:31:20,750
I plan to leave, and go on a journey.

357
00:31:20,750 --> 00:31:22,730
What?

358
00:31:22,730 --> 00:31:27,350
I wish to see the wider world,

359
00:31:27,350 --> 00:31:30,810
and decide how best to rebuild this country.

360
00:31:30,810 --> 00:31:33,335
See the wider world?

361
00:31:33,335 --> 00:31:34,825
Yes.

362
00:31:35,950 --> 00:31:38,010
You fool!

363
00:31:39,375 --> 00:31:42,080
That is what spies are for.

364
00:31:42,080 --> 00:31:47,690
They are our eyes and ears.

365
00:31:47,690 --> 00:31:51,730
A leader cannot roam the lands,
and put himself in danger.

366
00:31:51,730 --> 00:31:54,410
That is how I wish to establish a country.

367
00:31:55,150 --> 00:32:00,270
Must you see everything to build a nation?

368
00:32:00,270 --> 00:32:04,520
Such an endeavor
would take hundreds of years!

369
00:32:04,520 --> 00:32:07,210
If the Emperor now
sets foot outside his castle,

370
00:32:07,210 --> 00:32:10,425
and witnessed the state of this country,

371
00:32:10,425 --> 00:32:14,935
would he continue
to play ball as he does now?

372
00:32:15,658 --> 00:32:17,541
Song Jiang.

373
00:32:17,541 --> 00:32:23,475
I can only protect you now,
because you are still within my reach.

374
00:32:23,475 --> 00:32:28,625
Go on a journey,
and I will be unable to send aid.

375
00:32:29,255 --> 00:32:32,120
Leave the roaming to your spies.

376
00:32:32,120 --> 00:32:34,350
It is one thing to hear a recounting.

377
00:32:34,350 --> 00:32:36,940
It is another to see it for myself.

378
00:32:36,940 --> 00:32:40,100
I wish to truly feel our people's suffering.

379
00:32:40,100 --> 00:32:43,335
No emperor would do such a thing!

380
00:32:43,335 --> 00:32:46,475
Which is why countries fall to ruin!

381
00:32:55,235 --> 00:32:58,060
If you perish,

382
00:32:58,060 --> 00:33:01,215
the soul of Mount Liang dies with you.

383
00:33:01,215 --> 00:33:03,775
Can't you see that?

384
00:33:14,480 --> 00:33:16,590
"Enforcing the Way in Heaven's Name".

385
00:33:20,620 --> 00:33:24,920
Those writings are your very heart.

386
00:33:37,810 --> 00:33:42,950
If you earnestly believe that to be true,

387
00:33:43,850 --> 00:33:49,290
then you must let me be myself, Chao Gai.

388
00:33:53,900 --> 00:33:56,290
I will embark on this journey.

389
00:34:02,330 --> 00:34:03,870
I'm sorry.

390
00:34:08,540 --> 00:34:10,680
Song Jiang!

391
00:34:18,276 --> 00:34:20,046
Lu Zhi Shen also worried for you.

392
00:34:22,740 --> 00:34:27,210
He left you a souvenir,
in hopes he would help.

393
00:34:34,023 --> 00:34:35,967
At the very least,

394
00:34:37,487 --> 00:34:39,687
take him with you.

395
00:34:50,540 --> 00:34:52,450
You damn fool!

396
00:35:18,310 --> 00:35:19,950
Wu Song?

397
00:35:20,920 --> 00:35:22,790
Sir Song Jiang...

398
00:35:29,100 --> 00:35:32,620
Where have you been?

399
00:35:34,420 --> 00:35:39,290
I have been conversing with the earth.

400
00:35:41,020 --> 00:35:43,000
What did it have to say?

401
00:35:44,840 --> 00:35:47,140
It said to live, and struggle.

402
00:35:50,850 --> 00:35:53,130
To live, and fight.

403
00:36:06,270 --> 00:36:11,590
You've hurt your fists once again.

404
00:36:30,665 --> 00:36:33,520
You need not tell me.

405
00:36:33,520 --> 00:36:36,335
All our men sent to Song Jiang have died,
have they not?

406
00:36:36,335 --> 00:36:37,745
Yes, sir.

407
00:36:38,455 --> 00:36:40,980
He has practically incriminated himself.

408
00:36:40,980 --> 00:36:42,790
Shall we kill him?

409
00:36:43,450 --> 00:36:48,740
Killing Song Jiang will solve nothing.

410
00:36:49,645 --> 00:36:54,950
We must recruit Ma Gui to our side.
She will give us the intel we desire.

411
00:36:54,950 --> 00:36:59,450
Chivalrous bandits will prove difficult
to break apart, sir.

412
00:37:01,060 --> 00:37:04,100
Perhaps I shall start by tossing in a pebble.

413
00:37:08,236 --> 00:37:11,756
Even water birds who fly in perfect sync,

414
00:37:13,640 --> 00:37:17,250
scatter away in chaos...

415
00:37:19,560 --> 00:37:21,170
at the sound of a thrown stone.

416
00:37:21,830 --> 00:37:23,580
Meaning?

417
00:37:25,030 --> 00:37:30,080
I believe this Ma Gui has a daughter
named Yan Po Xi.

418
00:37:31,150 --> 00:37:33,220
We shall have this girl...

419
00:37:34,440 --> 00:37:36,580
see misfortune.

420
00:37:38,770 --> 00:37:40,800
I entrust my younger brother to you.

421
00:37:42,190 --> 00:37:44,160
It is a memento of our mother.

422
00:37:45,215 --> 00:37:49,490
I was told to offer this to my wife,

423
00:37:49,490 --> 00:37:52,390
but I do not see marriage in my near future.

424
00:37:55,020 --> 00:37:57,290
Instead, I shall gift it to you.

425
00:38:02,640 --> 00:38:05,910
This is all I can do for you both now.

426
00:38:07,625 --> 00:38:10,560
Thank you, I am honored.

427
00:38:10,560 --> 00:38:13,910
Show my younger brother
this sign of my approval.

428
00:38:15,600 --> 00:38:21,230
Say, has he told you of his childhood?

429
00:38:21,230 --> 00:38:23,350
No, not at all.

430
00:38:23,350 --> 00:38:27,410
Then allow me to indulge you.

431
00:38:33,600 --> 00:38:37,795
You are soon to become family, after all.

432
00:38:37,795 --> 00:38:42,525
I promise to find much happiness with him.

433
00:38:45,665 --> 00:38:50,480
This is a story of Qing
when he was just six years old.

434
00:38:50,480 --> 00:38:55,230
I had gone to get him
after my swordsmanship lessons,

435
00:38:55,230 --> 00:38:59,330
only for him to greet me with a glare.

436
00:38:59,330 --> 00:39:02,085
Of course, I asked what was wrong.

437
00:39:02,085 --> 00:39:07,235
Qing answered
by clutching his rear with both hands.

438
00:39:20,810 --> 00:39:23,630
Your people no longer have any enemies.

439
00:39:24,600 --> 00:39:30,000
Though I know killing them
will never ease the pain in your hearts.

440
00:39:31,650 --> 00:39:35,990
I plan to change this Mount Erlong.

441
00:39:36,625 --> 00:39:39,500
My men will work to protect
the surrounding villages.

442
00:39:39,500 --> 00:39:43,790
Then you will become a bandit?

443
00:39:47,410 --> 00:39:51,460
Deng Li Hua, will you make sure
I do not succumb to that fate?

444
00:39:53,190 --> 00:39:57,000
You are asking this of me?

445
00:40:10,860 --> 00:40:14,590
You cannot remain nameless forever.

446
00:40:16,950 --> 00:40:21,410
From this day forth,
you will be called, "Yang Ling".

447
00:40:23,230 --> 00:40:30,550
The Yang family are descendants
of the great hero, Yang Ye.

448
00:40:32,800 --> 00:40:34,850
Do not look so surprised.

449
00:40:35,830 --> 00:40:40,420
Though we are not tied by blood,

450
00:40:41,100 --> 00:40:47,000
we are connected by something else.

451
00:40:49,600 --> 00:40:51,630
Ambition.

452
00:40:52,286 --> 00:40:54,800
Listen well, Yang Ling.

453
00:40:54,800 --> 00:41:00,870
We are father and son, tied by our ambitions.

454
00:41:06,325 --> 00:41:08,430
Speak, my boy.

455
00:41:08,430 --> 00:41:11,414
Yang Ling.

456
00:41:11,414 --> 00:41:13,440
Once more.

457
00:41:13,440 --> 00:41:15,420
Yang Ling.

458
00:41:17,110 --> 00:41:18,660
Yes.

459
00:41:20,980 --> 00:41:22,580
That's right.

460
00:41:23,870 --> 00:41:25,410
That's your name.

461
00:41:36,500 --> 00:41:38,210
Sir Yang Zhi...

462
00:41:53,380 --> 00:41:55,000
Ji Ren Mei.

463
00:41:57,526 --> 00:42:00,426
Will you be this child's mother?

464
00:42:06,040 --> 00:42:07,460
I shall.

465
00:42:08,490 --> 00:42:10,930
And I will keep you on your honorable path.

466
00:42:11,570 --> 00:42:14,210
So that you may never become a bandit.

467
00:42:15,580 --> 00:42:16,950
Thank you.

468
00:42:29,970 --> 00:42:31,870
I cannot believe it.

469
00:42:34,750 --> 00:42:40,080
A man like myself, now a father.

470
00:42:51,015 --> 00:42:54,310
Has anything changed with Song Jiang?

471
00:42:54,310 --> 00:42:56,950
- I know nothing.
- Please, tell me anything at all.

472
00:42:56,950 --> 00:42:58,910
I am simply his attendant.

473
00:42:58,910 --> 00:43:00,850
You must know something.

474
00:43:00,850 --> 00:43:04,980
You are also hiding secrets, Mother.

475
00:43:04,980 --> 00:43:11,020
You, Song Jiang... everyone.

476
00:43:11,020 --> 00:43:13,560
- You do not need to know.
- Yes, I know nothing.

477
00:43:13,560 --> 00:43:16,600
So what about Song Jiang am I to report?

478
00:43:16,600 --> 00:43:19,060
- Po Xi!
- And Father!

479
00:43:19,060 --> 00:43:23,980
This grave, you, Song Jiang...

480
00:43:23,980 --> 00:43:26,380
Lies. It's all lies!

481
00:43:53,240 --> 00:43:56,050
Do you wish to know the truth, Po Xi?

482
00:44:00,040 --> 00:44:01,830
You are...

483
00:44:03,515 --> 00:44:06,150
Song Jiang, you will oversee this river.

484
00:44:06,150 --> 00:44:08,650
Sir, I cannot swim.

485
00:44:08,650 --> 00:44:10,645
How can a man not...

486
00:44:10,645 --> 00:44:13,025
Ow, ouch!

487
00:44:14,055 --> 00:44:16,530
What is the commotion?

488
00:44:16,530 --> 00:44:17,860
Wu Song?

489
00:44:17,860 --> 00:44:21,400
Tang Niu Er is up to no good.
It's in his eyes.

490
00:44:21,400 --> 00:44:23,210
His eyes? Is that all?

491
00:44:23,210 --> 00:44:24,585
Ouch!

492
00:44:24,585 --> 00:44:27,815
I cannot allow his suspicious gaze
to go unattended.

493
00:44:30,415 --> 00:44:35,950
Wu Song is usually correct
about these things.

494
00:44:35,950 --> 00:44:38,870
Tang Niu Er, what are you hiding from us?

495
00:44:46,095 --> 00:44:48,310
My firsts are like boulders.

496
00:44:48,310 --> 00:44:50,060
Resist, and you will crack.

497
00:44:50,060 --> 00:44:51,910
I...

498
00:44:51,910 --> 00:44:55,650
I sense you are attempting to lie.

499
00:44:55,650 --> 00:44:59,060
Tell us the truth, or you die.

500
00:44:59,060 --> 00:45:04,270
I love Yan Po Xi!

501
00:45:04,270 --> 00:45:05,480
Pardon?

502
00:45:05,480 --> 00:45:09,770
I only wished to tear her heart
away from you, sir.

503
00:45:09,770 --> 00:45:10,830
What have you done?

504
00:45:10,830 --> 00:45:13,440
I told Yan Po Xi a lie.

505
00:45:13,440 --> 00:45:15,650
What lie?

506
00:45:15,650 --> 00:45:18,370
Forgive me, sir!

507
00:45:18,370 --> 00:45:24,520
I told her you planned to marry Deng Li Hua.

508
00:45:24,520 --> 00:45:27,960
What have you done?

509
00:45:27,960 --> 00:45:30,365
I apologize for the commotion.

510
00:45:30,365 --> 00:45:32,185
Please, carry on.

511
00:45:48,960 --> 00:45:52,410
Song Jiang's life is in danger.

512
00:45:54,060 --> 00:45:58,090
In truth, he leads the bandits
gathered at Mount Liang.

513
00:45:59,090 --> 00:46:03,340
Your mother and father were both his spies.

514
00:46:03,990 --> 00:46:06,620
Are you beginning to see the full picture?

515
00:46:09,875 --> 00:46:13,470
Deng Li Hua is a spy sent in from Kaifeng.

516
00:46:13,470 --> 00:46:16,680
She was sent to end Song Jiang's life.

517
00:46:17,486 --> 00:46:22,900
Her beauty has tricked Song Jiang.
He will no longer listen to our words.

518
00:46:22,900 --> 00:46:25,881
But my mother, she...

519
00:46:25,881 --> 00:46:29,251
Ma Gui did not wish to get you involved.

520
00:46:33,919 --> 00:46:37,650
You are the one closest to Song Jiang.

521
00:46:37,650 --> 00:46:41,620
I want you to protect him for us.

522
00:46:44,495 --> 00:46:49,190
I will do anything.

523
00:46:49,190 --> 00:46:51,840
If it will protect Song Jiang, anything.

524
00:46:55,440 --> 00:46:57,250
Then please, accept this.

525
00:46:59,940 --> 00:47:02,870
They are moon cakes, laced with oleander.

526
00:47:43,070 --> 00:47:44,840
I...

527
00:47:46,770 --> 00:47:50,130
I long for Sir Song Jiang.

528
00:47:54,980 --> 00:48:00,370
- I...
- I feel similarly.

529
00:48:03,100 --> 00:48:05,870
Your eyes, they are filled with sorrow.

530
00:48:08,910 --> 00:48:14,620
I suspect we both had a rough upbringing.

531
00:48:21,290 --> 00:48:26,930
The weak are given no chance in this world.

532
00:48:28,740 --> 00:48:32,250
Yet Song Jiang promises
to bring about change.

533
00:48:36,836 --> 00:48:38,626
I believe he will make it happen.

534
00:48:39,835 --> 00:48:42,690
Deng Li Hua!

535
00:48:42,690 --> 00:48:44,555
Song Qing?

536
00:48:44,555 --> 00:48:46,355
What brings you here?

537
00:48:49,730 --> 00:48:55,000
Since it will soon be known,
I shall tell you.

538
00:48:56,190 --> 00:49:00,800
Deng Li Hua and I are to get married.

539
00:49:03,005 --> 00:49:05,270
Married?

540
00:49:05,270 --> 00:49:07,020
I expect you are surprised.

541
00:49:07,020 --> 00:49:12,085
Deng Li Hua was acting
as my brother's mistress after all.

542
00:49:12,085 --> 00:49:13,685
Why?

543
00:49:14,780 --> 00:49:18,000
Why would he tell such a lie?

544
00:49:18,825 --> 00:49:21,110
I do not know myself.

545
00:49:21,110 --> 00:49:25,160
My brother will speak about it
when he returns home.

546
00:49:33,615 --> 00:49:36,160
Deng Li Hua? Deng Li Hua!

547
00:49:36,160 --> 00:49:38,200
Deng Li Hua!

548
00:50:04,120 --> 00:50:05,620
Was this...

549
00:50:14,940 --> 00:50:17,010
You poisoned her.

550
00:50:22,067 --> 00:50:24,877
Was it?

551
00:50:27,560 --> 00:50:29,200
Po Xi?

552
00:50:31,190 --> 00:50:33,200
Po Xi, are you here?

553
00:50:37,960 --> 00:50:39,750
Brother...

554
00:50:40,605 --> 00:50:43,060
Deng Li Hua has died.

555
00:50:43,060 --> 00:50:45,750
That woman killed her!

556
00:50:46,650 --> 00:50:48,600
She was poisoned...

557
00:50:51,030 --> 00:50:52,660
Po Xi.

558
00:50:53,650 --> 00:50:58,710
I poisoned her.

559
00:50:59,950 --> 00:51:01,500
Why?

560
00:51:02,980 --> 00:51:12,460
I was told Deng Li Hua
was a spy sent to kill you.

561
00:51:12,460 --> 00:51:15,170
Who would tell such a ridiculous lie?

562
00:51:17,320 --> 00:51:19,220
Qinglian Temple.

563
00:51:21,270 --> 00:51:23,630
I was told the medicine...

564
00:51:24,730 --> 00:51:26,750
would save you.

565
00:51:30,160 --> 00:51:36,790
Po Xi, my enemies are the ones
who gave you this medicine.

566
00:51:40,390 --> 00:51:42,250
Sir Song Jiang.

567
00:51:44,740 --> 00:51:52,250
Who are you really?

568
00:51:56,150 --> 00:51:57,840
I...

569
00:52:00,245 --> 00:52:03,440
Even now, I know nothing...

570
00:52:03,440 --> 00:52:06,500
Po Xi. Po Xi!

571
00:52:11,340 --> 00:52:13,630
I was so...

572
00:52:15,690 --> 00:52:17,800
very far from you.

573
00:52:20,780 --> 00:52:22,450
Po Xi.

574
00:52:23,730 --> 00:52:25,370
Po Xi!

575
00:52:35,100 --> 00:52:40,250
I wanted to keep you away from danger.

576
00:52:42,420 --> 00:52:45,080
That is why I told you nothing.

577
00:52:45,860 --> 00:52:47,950
Song Jiang...

578
00:52:50,240 --> 00:52:52,930
Deng Li Hua was killed.

579
00:52:54,650 --> 00:52:56,450
Brother.

580
00:52:58,270 --> 00:53:00,420
She murdered my love.

581
00:53:01,406 --> 00:53:08,006
If only I arrived a moment earlier...

582
00:53:11,400 --> 00:53:13,540
You both...

583
00:53:15,190 --> 00:53:19,790
were supposed to become happy.

584
00:53:30,325 --> 00:53:32,720
Song Jiang, we must leave at once.

585
00:53:32,720 --> 00:53:36,500
If I had arrived a moment earlier...

586
00:53:45,940 --> 00:53:50,550
Tang Niu Er will speak of this
to the local officers.

587
00:53:52,060 --> 00:53:53,750
Song Qing.

588
00:53:55,430 --> 00:53:58,860
I will take all the blame for this incident.

589
00:53:58,860 --> 00:54:01,695
You must head to Mount Liang.

590
00:54:01,695 --> 00:54:03,695
Song Jiang...

591
00:54:06,875 --> 00:54:09,600
What a fool I am.

592
00:54:09,600 --> 00:54:13,170
As if I could change a nation as I stand now.

593
00:54:15,085 --> 00:54:18,230
I could not even hear the voice of Po Xi,

594
00:54:18,230 --> 00:54:23,040
who was right at my side.

595
00:54:28,120 --> 00:54:33,190
The fault lies with myself alone.

596
00:54:37,560 --> 00:54:39,960
What will you do now?

597
00:54:58,505 --> 00:55:00,870
I will embark on a journey.

598
00:55:00,870 --> 00:55:02,420
A journey?

599
00:55:30,750 --> 00:55:32,910
Charge!

600
00:55:34,040 --> 00:55:35,750
Charge!

601
00:55:37,230 --> 00:55:39,000
Make way!

602
00:56:11,245 --> 00:56:12,600
Stay in formation.

603
00:56:12,600 --> 00:56:15,330
- Charge!
- Yes, sir!

604
00:56:45,830 --> 00:56:48,850
[Song Jiang]

605
00:56:50,240 --> 00:56:51,880
You fool.

606
00:56:58,850 --> 00:57:00,550
Song Jiang.

607
00:57:02,906 --> 00:57:07,336
Return to us alive!

608
00:57:11,820 --> 00:57:14,680
Calm yourself, Chao Gai.

609
00:57:35,690 --> 00:57:41,420
Mount Liang is still too far
for a man like myself.

610
00:59:49,070 --> 00:59:54,870
[Finale - FIN]

